WEBVTT

00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:11.720
In this video I show how to set an alarm with healthchecks.io for when your AI Detector stops, so that you are notified.

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:15.260
To start, we first have to sign in to Healthchecks.

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:18.200
First you enter your e-mail address here.

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:22.160
Then you confirm it.

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:27.920
You get an e-mail; click the login link in it.

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:32.260
Then you are signed in to the website right away.

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:36.480
Then go to your account and set a password.

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:42.480
First they ask again for a confirmation code that is sent to your e-mail.

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:44.500
And then you can create a password.

00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:49.050
At this point you have created an account.

00:00:50.410 --> 00:00:54.390
Then we add Telegram, because that is where we want to be alerted.

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:58.410
The website itself also describes how to do that.

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:00.770
And I will show it now.

00:01:01.270 --> 00:01:14.050
What you do: go to Add Telegram.

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:17.370
Type in: add Healthchecks bot.

00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:21.330
Make sure you have the right one, then start it.

00:01:25.880 --> 00:01:29.100
It then asks you to open that special link.

00:01:29.660 --> 00:01:34.100
Here you sign in again with your e-mail address and the password you just created.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:42.100
And here it asks you to confirm connecting Telegram.

00:01:43.380 --> 00:01:46.340
Then click Connect Telegram.

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:48.840
From this point on you have...

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:53.000
...the option to be notified by e-mail and by Telegram.

00:01:57.890 --> 00:02:00.550
Down here you can set a schedule.

00:02:00.810 --> 00:02:05.730
We want a ping to be sent to the website every minute.

00:02:05.870 --> 00:02:08.070
You can also set it to 10 minutes or 20 minutes.

00:02:08.650 --> 00:02:10.210
And a special grace time.

00:02:10.690 --> 00:02:17.130
The grace time is the time after the last ping was or was not received.

00:02:17.130 --> 00:02:22.530
In this case it first waits an hour before it alerts you.

00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:26.710
So you are not disturbed straight away as soon as it stops.

00:02:29.270 --> 00:02:31.970
We go to the AI Detector web app.

00:02:32.770 --> 00:02:38.670
There we add the option under Advanced.

00:02:40.290 --> 00:02:41.830
What we do: you type in...

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:44.310
We go to CowCatcher AI on GitHub.

00:02:47.940 --> 00:02:50.740
And you look for the file health indicator.json.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:51.800
Click it.

00:02:51.800 --> 00:02:55.800
And copy these...

00:02:57.160 --> 00:02:58.260
Five lines.

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:03.840
Then go back to the web app.

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:06.200
Make sure it is in there.

00:03:06.340 --> 00:03:08.760
Look carefully at the example, at the number of spaces.

00:03:13.370 --> 00:03:14.450
Put it in like this.

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:24.110
Then replace the https hc-ping link with the one from the website.

00:03:24.950 --> 00:03:26.930
The one you received.

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:29.810
It is at the top there.

00:03:30.170 --> 00:03:31.070
Here: How To Ping.

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:32.070
Copy it.

00:03:32.070 --> 00:03:33.070
You can click it once.

00:03:33.070 --> 00:03:34.070
Then it is copied automatically.

00:03:34.070 --> 00:03:35.070
Then paste it with Ctrl+V.

00:03:35.070 --> 00:03:37.070
Now it is in there.

00:03:37.070 --> 00:03:39.070
And then click Save.

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:45.070
Well, as usual, you start the AI Detector now.

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:48.510
The way you are used to.

00:03:48.510 --> 00:03:50.510
Here is an example of it having started.

00:03:50.510 --> 00:03:54.510
And you get a message in Telegram that it has started.

00:03:54.510 --> 00:03:56.510
Then it is green.

00:03:56.510 --> 00:04:00.510
We can do the same in the configuration file.

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:02.510
We just did that.

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:03.510
This is of course a second option.

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:05.510
Fill it in here as well.

00:04:05.510 --> 00:04:07.510
And then you can save here too.

00:04:07.510 --> 00:04:10.510
There are two ways to set it up.

00:04:10.510 --> 00:04:11.510
Well, again.

00:04:11.510 --> 00:04:12.510
You start it.

00:04:12.510 --> 00:04:13.510
Once you have done that.

00:04:13.510 --> 00:04:14.510
There are two ways.

00:04:14.510 --> 00:04:15.510
Either through the web app.

00:04:15.510 --> 00:04:18.510
Or directly in the configuration file.

00:04:18.510 --> 00:04:23.290
Well, here again for example.

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:24.290
You start it.

00:04:24.290 --> 00:04:38.820
As you know.

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:40.820
It always takes a while to start.

00:04:40.820 --> 00:04:44.820
And here again the example that it has started.

00:04:44.820 --> 00:04:46.820
Because there it comes.

00:04:46.820 --> 00:04:49.820
And for example when you stop it.

00:04:49.820 --> 00:04:51.820
Or it has been closed.

00:04:51.820 --> 00:04:53.820
Then a red alert comes in.

00:04:53.820 --> 00:04:56.820
And on the website you can also see whether it is online.

00:04:56.820 --> 00:05:02.470
And that's it.
